# personal-brand strategy layer — private working notes for the repositioning
# initiative (positioning, canonical copy, sync playbook, backlog). Local only,
# never published: this repo is public.
.brand/

# scratch — the ONE place for throwaway files (PR bodies, commit messages). Ignored rather than
# absent, so a scratch write lands somewhere NAMED instead of somewhere random: the failure this
# replaces was an agent leaving a bundled `dist-old-qa/` at a repo path nothing ignored, which
# dirtied `git status` and broke local lint with 1480 errors. Emptied at the start of every new
# session by the plugin's `session-scratch` hook — see CLAUDE.md for what does and does not belong.
.scratch/

# editor / os
.DS_Store
*.log

# Claude Code — personal/local overrides (e.g. autoMemoryDirectory). Never committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
